  "title": "Tycho Brahe",
  "summary": "Tycho Brahe, a Danish nobleman born in Skåne on 14 December 1546, was the leading observational astronomer before the telescope. Given the island of Hven in 1576, he built the Uraniborg observatory there, left in 1597, and died in Prague on 24 October 1601.",
